{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_015_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:96ef399695d72adb0f09877fd26af0e5b84c075c25c8ecbc6591b9a6b93fbc03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ffe177c069248dc8b72bf2cd418d67c491909f7208aae1f660fd5a6b842073",
      "text": "慌里慌张的真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c59e39e53e439f1fb6799062ccd2b897c86243c174d02846f5529ea78805ce0",
      "text": "让您看到丢人的一面了，啊哈哈……\n因为它跟老爸每天用的生发剂太像了，忍不住就。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b955e965a78700e6bd90744d425fa762fa88d17dc71cc550edf3029e9874254",
      "text": "其实我老爸头发比较稀疏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11059bd0295611bcea3e3028ea502008c6f2da4bd67941305fe3d357f419e885",
      "text": "我就很担心自己将来\n会不会也变秃……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b32e8b28abbf20ee22f06aede8eac16ad464f75d804834dbf4cb836aafe7196c",
      "text": "没想到竟然会和家里的生发剂包装撞车，\n真让人意想不到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dcfc3e35c08393bf4aa642cce8934a74a6ff647c32052dd99195e5ff3976d3c",
      "text": "哈哈，我也没想到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5110601bcef85f9154bda1e4aa40afa779f0cb212a922ad79a95c5b3b3aea7c",
      "text": "所以我用梳子梳头的时候也尽量不使劲揉搓，\n稍微注意了一下，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52808ad302125c390a882e69a32bc2cd6b771ec5c885f3ddfe9dca50b9e31c8b",
      "text": "当消防员的时候也尽量注意\n不让头发一直闷着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9ba12504673526f60bb2dedb7c76192e2b20e4ac544e2fd237e29297564ae24",
      "text": "您从以前就开始注意护发了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db396ba5ba074b625f07efd352d59e1908b151fbac672a6faa7ce81d26e01fba",
      "text": "因为看到老爸在用，\n我就觉得我也得多注意才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
